OL,3,GNEWSACharity soapbox event will return
OL,4,Aafter town debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity spectacle featuring teams
OL,7,Fracing soapboxes, after they designed
OL,8,Fand built them, will return to Telford
OL,9,Fnext summer.
OL,11,FThe town's first Krazy Races welcomed
OL,12,Faround 7,000 spectators and 26 teams
OL,13,Ffor "racing, outrageous costumes and
OL,14,Fcreative homemade karts", Telford &
OL,15,FWrekin Council said.
OL,17,FThe event raised more than #10,000 for
OL,18,Flocal good causes, including over
OL,19,F#1,000 for headline charity, Lingen
OL,20,FDavies Cancer Support's Sunflower
OL,21,FAppeal.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
