OL,3,GNEWSACharity soapbox event will return
OL,4,Aafter town debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FApplications are now open to local
OL,7,Fbusinesses, schools, colleges,
OL,8,Fcommunity groups, charities, families
OL,9,Fand groups of friends ahead of the
OL,10,Ftouring soapbox derby returning to
OL,11,FTelford Town Park on 11 July.
